   the sweep        : 36 pairs in 26 space groups, 0 of them double-valued
   by site symmetry : 16 where the site irreps are A, B1, B2, B3
                      12 where the site irreps are A1, A2, B1, B2
                      8 where the site irreps are Ag, Au, B1g, B1u, B2g, B2u, B3g, B3u
   by the members   : 14 of B2 and B3, 14 of B1 and B2, 3 of B2u and B3u,
                      3 of B2g and B3g, 1 of B1u and B2u, 1 of B1g and B2g
   space groups     : 90, 97, 100, 101, 102, 105, 107, 108, 109, 113, 117, 120, 127,
                      128, 130, 133, 135, 137, 138, 140, 142, 197, 201, 204, 211, 230
   both members of each pair carry the same SRSIs, Z-valued and valued modulo n, so
